    oe:questionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Hypothyroidism?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Hypothyroidism, the deficiency of thyroid hormone, is a common condition worldwide. It affects almost all body systems and has a wide variety of clinical presentations from being asymptomatic to, in rare cases, life threatening."^^xsd:string ;
